<configuration>
  <!-- Bai 11: them nuget.org de `dotnet restore` chay duoc tren may clone moi
       (project can Minio + xUnit). Neu truong build offline bang cache rieng,
       co the xoa dong <add ...> va dung lai cache noi bo. -->
